// Granted/refreshed by HotFuseSkillAction's sibling BirthdayCakeSkillAction (Bunny Bomb Hero Skill
// Ascension) - turns Bunny Bomb into a grouping tool: read at the bomb's own landing
// (ProjectileSystem.TryPlant) to add the existing Decoy tag onto the LANDED bomb entity itself (not
// the flying projectile - replaces the old DecoyOnThrowUpgrade flight-time taunt) and drive its fuse
// timer from TauntDuration instead of the bomb's own authored PlantedFuseTime. Read again at
// detonation (ExplodeOnDestroyUtility.TryDetonate/AreaHitData.Detonate) - TauntRadiusMultiplier scales
// the blast radius itself (the generic decoy-pull mechanic has no radius knob of its own to scale
// without hardcoding into shared enemy AI, so a bigger blast is this ascension's actual "wider taunt"
// lever), and rank 3's HasBonusDamage scales the whole detonation's damage - both gated on the
// detonating entity currently being a Decoy, so this only ever fires for Birthday Cake's own landed
// bomb, never Pocket Bombs's Mini Bomb or a dropped DashBomb.
component BirthdayCakeUpgrade
{
    FP TauntDuration;
    FP TauntRadiusMultiplier;
    Boolean HasBonusDamage;
    FP BonusDamageMultiplier;
}
